note.p:
Telegram 2316 is Document 118. Telegrams 72, 69, and 19
                    from Vientiane, July 15, 14, and 6, are in Department of State, Central Files,
                    751J.00/7–1561, 751J.00/7–1461, and 751J.00/7–661, respectively.

In telegram 20, July 5, the Department asked for the Country Team’s suggestions
                    for nonmilitary ways to support the RLG and the King within Laos. (Ibid.,
                    751J.00/7–461)
